import Counting.PlanarClassification

/-! The complete algebraic nonnegative planar homomorphism dichotomy.

The closed original Theorems 1.1 and 1.3 are exposed as
`PlanarHom.MainDichotomyScope.theorem11` and `theorem13`. They retain the fixed
algebraic symmetric matrix, unit or positive vertex weights, identical-row
quotient with class-weight sums, and ordinary raw planar input promises.
Loops, parallel edges, isolated vertices and the empty domain are not excluded.
Hardness uses the original charged promise Turing reductions. The arbitrary-real
appendix is a separate result and is not asserted by this entry.
-/
